# Kotlin/Native
.konan/

# Node. package.json/package-lock.json ARE tracked — they are the only reproducible
# record of the sharp version that renders design/iconography. The tree itself was
# committed once by accident and carried a 17 MB arm64-only .dylib.
node_modules/

# IDE
.idea/

# Per-machine Claude Code permissions. settings.json is the shared, reviewed
# allowlist; .local.json is whatever this machine has approved and should not be
# published -- on a public repo it advertises which commands run unprompted.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Tool configs (local only)
.codex/
AGENTS.md

# Personal scratch list carried between sessions. Not a project doc — docs/ holds those.
TODO_TOMORROW.md
graphify-out/

# General Kotlin/KMP skills are symlinks into a separate repo on this machine, so their
# targets are absolute paths that resolve for nobody else. Only the corta-spam-* skills,
# which are about this codebase, stay tracked.
.claude/skills/kotlin-*

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Signing material. Added before any key exists, deliberately — docs/PLAY_INTERNAL_TESTING.md
# tells you to create corta-spam-upload.jks and keystore.properties in this directory, and a
# committed upload key cannot be un-published from a public repo's history.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
androidApp/keystore.properties
*.p12
*.pepk
play-service-account*.json
